{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Throw rocks. Score points. Trick the system.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chaos Rocks</i> is a physics-based puzzle game where every level challenges you to bounce a rock into one of three buckets using gadgets, angles, and sheer stubbornness. Upgrade your tools, automate your points, and master ridiculous trick shots in a stylized, cartoony world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udea8 Simple Goal. Absurd Execution.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/2bd3085e0f0da5a1df53b46193325dd3.poster.avif?t=1759769695\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/2bd3085e0f0da5a1df53b46193325dd3.webm?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/2bd3085e0f0da5a1df53b46193325dd3.mp4?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up a rock. Throw it in a bucket. Easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now try doing it across a backyard, city, off a trampoline, banking from a corner board \u2014 without tipping a bucket and losing everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f Automate Your Rock Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too busy flinging rocks to mine them? Deploy <strong>drones</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine rocks</strong> automatically to earn points over time while you work towards the Victory Bucket.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade drone <strong>speed</strong>, <strong>capacity</strong>, and <strong>battery life</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your automation handle the grind while you focus on your next masterpiece shot</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udea3 Three Buckets. Three Fates.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/a913986e538d75ee9ed678aac39a488b.poster.avif?t=1759769695\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/a913986e538d75ee9ed678aac39a488b.webm?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/a913986e538d75ee9ed678aac39a488b.mp4?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point Bucket</strong> \u2013 Your score machine. Don\u2019t tip it.<br>\ud83d\udd13 Upgrade for bonus points and stability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trick Bucket</strong> \u2013 Hidden. Hard to hit. Worth it.<br>\ud83c\udfaf Score big if you land it. No penalty if you fail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Victory Bucket</strong> \u2013 Land it to beat the level.<br>\ud83c\udf00 Unlock a <strong>Gravity Well</strong> to bend your shot into it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udeb5 Backboards: Your Best (and Worst) Friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/8dc6d50c74b2bf87a53bfb0a6a1e2987.poster.avif?t=1759769695\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/8dc6d50c74b2bf87a53bfb0a6a1e2987.webm?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/8dc6d50c74b2bf87a53bfb0a6a1e2987.mp4?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own throw path using <strong>9 unique backboards made of 2 materials</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wood </strong>slows the rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trampolines</strong> boost it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From flat progress boards to tricky 45\u00b0 corner setups, you'll need the right boards in the right place to land the perfect shot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Hidden Skulls &amp; Bonus Goals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/cf29bd98cf2c67068f8546793ff921f1.poster.avif?t=1759769695\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/cf29bd98cf2c67068f8546793ff921f1.webm?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/cf29bd98cf2c67068f8546793ff921f1.mp4?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level hides secret <strong>Skull Rocks</strong>.<br>Hit them mid-air for bonus points and bragging rights. You know you want to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based rock throwing with stylized, cel-shaded visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build elaborate trick shot setups with 9 backboard types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate your income with fully upgradeable drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk/reward gameplay with 3 unique bucket types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectibles and bonus score routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively challenging levels with new obstacles and layouts</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760450?t=1759769695","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/15579748cde8484ffe71cf8a6471b8be07d2623e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759769695","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/7cd9e2e6cb17c96ef9f5f15931152d022c5519e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759769695","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/7cd9e2e6cb17c96ef9f5f15931152d022c5519e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759769695","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Throw rocks. Score points. Trick the system.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chaos Rocks</i> is a physics-based puzzle game where every level challenges you to bounce a rock into one of three buckets using gadgets, angles, and sheer stubbornness. Upgrade your tools, automate your points, and master ridiculous trick shots in a stylized, cartoony world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udea8 Simple Goal. Absurd Execution.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/2bd3085e0f0da5a1df53b46193325dd3.poster.avif?t=1759769695\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/2bd3085e0f0da5a1df53b46193325dd3.webm?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/2bd3085e0f0da5a1df53b46193325dd3.mp4?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up a rock. Throw it in a bucket. Easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now try doing it across a backyard, city, off a trampoline, banking from a corner board \u2014 without tipping a bucket and losing everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f Automate Your Rock Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too busy flinging rocks to mine them? Deploy <strong>drones</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine rocks</strong> automatically to earn points over time while you work towards the Victory Bucket.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade drone <strong>speed</strong>, <strong>capacity</strong>, and <strong>battery life</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your automation handle the grind while you focus on your next masterpiece shot</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udea3 Three Buckets. Three Fates.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/a913986e538d75ee9ed678aac39a488b.poster.avif?t=1759769695\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/a913986e538d75ee9ed678aac39a488b.webm?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/a913986e538d75ee9ed678aac39a488b.mp4?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point Bucket</strong> \u2013 Your score machine. Don\u2019t tip it.<br>\ud83d\udd13 Upgrade for bonus points and stability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trick Bucket</strong> \u2013 Hidden. Hard to hit. Worth it.<br>\ud83c\udfaf Score big if you land it. No penalty if you fail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Victory Bucket</strong> \u2013 Land it to beat the level.<br>\ud83c\udf00 Unlock a <strong>Gravity Well</strong> to bend your shot into it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udeb5 Backboards: Your Best (and Worst) Friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/8dc6d50c74b2bf87a53bfb0a6a1e2987.poster.avif?t=1759769695\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/8dc6d50c74b2bf87a53bfb0a6a1e2987.webm?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/8dc6d50c74b2bf87a53bfb0a6a1e2987.mp4?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own throw path using <strong>9 unique backboards made of 2 materials</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wood </strong>slows the rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trampolines</strong> boost it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From flat progress boards to tricky 45\u00b0 corner setups, you'll need the right boards in the right place to land the perfect shot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Hidden Skulls &amp; Bonus Goals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/cf29bd98cf2c67068f8546793ff921f1.poster.avif?t=1759769695\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/cf29bd98cf2c67068f8546793ff921f1.webm?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/cf29bd98cf2c67068f8546793ff921f1.mp4?t=1759769695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level hides secret <strong>Skull Rocks</strong>.<br>Hit them mid-air for bonus points and bragging rights. You know you want to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based rock throwing with stylized, cel-shaded visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build elaborate trick shot setups with 9 backboard types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate your income with fully upgradeable drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk/reward gameplay with 3 unique bucket types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectibles and bonus score routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively challenging levels with new obstacles and layouts</p></li></ul>","developers":["Cntrl Kill Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/34c38baf68e7cb639e45e4c303db27ebcf940832/header.jpg?t=1759769695","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3760450/1933629694/c106dda14775e37fa5dc6829fdf3f3301dff4e57/1752376865/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752610632","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3760450/1933629694/c106dda14775e37fa5dc6829fdf3f3301dff4e57/1752376865/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752610632","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3760450/1933629694/c106dda14775e37fa5dc6829fdf3f3301dff4e57/1752376865/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752610632","id":257168289,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168289/movie480.mp4?t=1752610632","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257168289/movie_max.mp4?t=1752610632"},"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s